"If this fails, your Elasticsearch installation is probably broken.\n"
"Try completely purging and reinstalling Elasticsearch according to\n"
"our [installation guide](/en/tutorials/install-elasticsearch).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/connect-config-elasticsearch.md:140
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 2: Verify the Ingest-Attachment Plugin is Installed Correctly <Badge "
"type=\"warning\" text=\"only ES7\" />"
