#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:116
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cp /opt/zammad/contrib/nginx/zammad_ssl.conf "
"/etc/nginx/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:120
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2 - Adjust the Config File"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:123
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:199
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Adjust the just copied file with a text editor of your choice (e.g. vi or "
"nano)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:126
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Locate any ``server_name`` directive and adjust ``example.com`` to the "
"domain of your Zammad instance."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:129
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:205
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Now you'll need to adjust the path and file names for your ssl certificates "
"you obtained. Adjust the following directives to match your setup:"
